          "text": "Umubarire, ut’ Uhoraho, Imana y’Abaheburayo, yakuntumyeko, ngo Reka abantu biwe bagende, bamusabire mu bugaragwa: uti Kandi none gushitsa ubu nturamwumvira. ",
          "type": "text",
