        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abarira Mose, ati Bgira Aroni, uti Jana inkoni witwaje, uramvure ukuboko kwawe hejuru y’amazi yo muri Egiputa, ku nzūzi zabo, no ku migende y’amazi yabo, no ku bidengeri vyabo, n’ah’ amazi ateze hose, ahinduke amaraso; kandi mu gihugu cose ca Egiputa haraba amaraso, ari mu māto, canke mu mpange zābājwe mu mabuye.",
