              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’abanyamarēba bo muri Egiputa na bo babigira bartyo babikoresheje amarēba yabo: umutima wa Farawo urakomantara, ntiyumvira Mose na Aroni, nk’ uk’ Uhoraho yari yaravuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
